Milestone 2 requires you to generate data visualizations of your Milestone 1 using Matplotlib and Seaborn. The deliverables of the activity are provided to you ahead of time to help you with the development:



  To carry out this activity, follow the instructions below:﻿
  
  1 . Revisit your finalized Milestone 1. Using Matplotlib and Seaborn, generate data visualizations supporting your output's results and findings.
  
  2. Make a copy of the Data Visualization Documentation Template, add the activity name, your team’s section, and last name, and initial at the end of the title beside the Google Docs icon on the top left of the screen.



      Example:
      
      MO-IT125 Draft of Milestone 2: Data Visualization on Machine Learning Solution Project BSIT-A1101 Dela Cruz, J., Santiago, C., Garcia, R.



  3. Accomplish the instructions provided in the template. 
  
  4. Once done, update your Milestone 2’ draft’s file-sharing settings and ensure anyone from MMDC can comment. 
  
  5. Copy the link to your Milestone 2 draft and paste it here on Camu. This is carried out by your Milestone 2 Team Leader.
